  "contentHtml": "<p><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이스트를 &nbsp;보지 못한 아이들이 의외로 많더군요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">효모의 발효를 이해하는 방법이 다양하겠지만 자유학기제 과학 동아리 수업으로 호떡 만들기를 선택하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이스트를 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">45</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도의 물에 녹여 냄새와 맛을 보고 반죽을 시작하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.  </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">숟가락이 성에 차지 않는지 손으로 직접 반죽하겠답니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">조물조물</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">~ 10</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">분 정도 지나자 반죽이 보글보글</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">~ </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">설탕을 넣고 호떡 모양을 빚어 큰 접시에 올려놓은 다음에 구우면 의외로 시간이 절약되더라고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">역할 분담을 하여 마가린을 녹이는 친구</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">호떡을 뒤집는 친구</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">굽는 친구</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">…</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">다 만든 후에 담임과 부담임 선생님께 배달하고 맛있게 나누어 먹었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아이들의 행복한 표정을 올리고 싶으나 일일이 허락받아야 하여 이번에는 예쁜이들의 모습은 싣지 않았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이것 하느라고 전기렌지 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">대를 더 구입하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기존의 핫플레이트는 온도가 낮아 요리용으로는 부족한 감이 있어서요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">11</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 전에 광주로 처음 와서 했던 과학캠프의 주제가 요리과학이었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">중학생인데도 어찌나 요리를 잘하던지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">…</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">^^ </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그 후에도 학교 행사나 과학시간에 요리 잘하는 아이들을 보면 감탄사가 절로 나왔습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">중학교 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학년이 만들었다고 믿어지지 않을 정도로 예쁘게 완성한 호떡</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">! </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사진에 보이시지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">맛도 훌륭했답니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/221E943C5853587D04\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"SDC13981.jpg\"  id=\"A_221E943C5853587D04FD55\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/253571375853588B0B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"SDC13983.jpg\"  id=\"A_253571375853588B0B99E2\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2723FE385853589B25\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"SDC13985.jpg\"  id=\"A_2723FE385853589B250116\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; 